1  | ∃x (P(x) ∧ ¬Q(x))
2  | ∀x (P(x) → Q(f(x)))
   |----
3  | | [a] P(a) ∧ ¬Q(a)
   | |----
4  | | P(a)                      ∧ Elim: 3
5  | | ¬Q(a)                     ∧ Elim: 3
6  | | | a=f(a)
   | | |----
7  | | | P(a) → Q(f(a))          ∀ Elim: 2
8  | | | Q(f(a))                 → Elim: 7,4
9  | | | ¬Q(f(a))                = Elim: 5, 6
10 | | | ⊥                       ⊥ Intro: 8, 9
11 | | ¬(a=f(a))                 ¬ Intro: 6-10
12 | | ∃x ¬(x=f(x))              ∃ Intro: 11
13 | ∃x ¬(x=f(x))                ∃ Elim: 1, 3-12
